  "description": "Reincarnated as a nameless commoner on Raniakea, the continent of magic and steel, with memories of 21st century Earth. To escape the life of a commoner, who is almost like a slave, he must lift the 'Magic Stone' and become a Giant Rider. \n\n‘Straighten your back!’ ‘Tighten your belly!’ ‘Take a deep breath into the bottom of your abdomen!’. He uses knowledge from his previous life as a trainer to accumulate magical power as if he were exercising, and climbs the ladder of the social hierarchy.\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/63415654?utm_source=sh_clip%20%5B%EC%B9%B4%EC%B9%B4%EC%98%A4%ED%8E%98%EC%9D%B4%EC%A7%80%20%7C%20%EC%9B%B9%ED%88%B0%5D%201RM%EC%9D%98%20%EA%B8%B0%EA%B0%84%ED%8A%B8%20%EB%9D%BC%EC%9D%B4%EB%8D%94&plpu=https%3A%2F%2Flink-page.kakao.com%2Fopen%2Fcontent%3Fseries_id%3D63415654%26utm_source%3Dsh_clip%2520%255B%25EC%25B9%25B4%25EC%25B9%25B4%25EC%2598%25A4%25ED%258E%2598%25EC%259D%25B4%25EC%25A7%2580%2520%257C%2520%25EC%259B%25B9%25ED%2588%25B0%255D%25201RM%25EC%259D%2598%2520%25EA%25B8%25B0%25EA%25B0%2584%25ED%258A%25B8%2520%25EB%259D%25BC%25EC%259D%25B4%25EB%258D%2594%26alfallback%3Dstore), [Daum](https://webtoon.kakao.com/content/1RM%EC%9D%98-%EA%B8%B0%EA%B0%84%ED%8A%B8-%EB%9D%BC%EC%9D%B4%EB%8D%94/3926?tab=episode)",
